Builds made with the `extended` feature set additionally embed the following
language model crates (all 1.3.0, Apache-2.0):

  * lingua-french-language-model
  * lingua-german-language-model
  * lingua-spanish-language-model
  * lingua-italian-language-model
  * lingua-portuguese-language-model
  * lingua-dutch-language-model
  * lingua-russian-language-model
  * lingua-polish-language-model
  * lingua-swedish-language-model
  * lingua-turkish-language-model
  * lingua-indonesian-language-model
  * lingua-vietnamese-language-model

The compiled `langid` helper binary statically links the language model data
from these crates. Language model data is embedded at build time; no files are
downloaded or read at run time.

The helper binary also statically links the transitive Rust dependencies listed
in Cargo.lock. Their licenses (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD and Unlicense variants) are
compatible with this project's Apache-2.0 license.

